sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Admin
    participant B as Browser
    participant C as Admin DestinationController
    participant S as Storage (disk public)
    participant M as Destination (Model)
    participant DB as MySQL

    A->>B: Isi form, pilih foto, klik peta (koordinat)
    B->>C: POST multipart/form-data
    C->>C: validateData()
    C->>S: cover_photo->store('destinations','public')
    S-->>C: path file
    C->>M: Destination::create([...])
    M->>DB: INSERT INTO destinations
    DB-->>M: destinasi tersimpan
    C->>M: storeGalleryPhotos()
    loop tiap foto galeri
        C->>S: file->store('destinations','public')
        S-->>C: path
        C->>DB: INSERT INTO destination_photos
    end
    C-->>B: redirect ke /admin/destinasi
    B-->>A: Tampilkan destinasi baru di daftar
